# Apptainer definition file for GeoCoT environment.
#
# BUILDTIME: Pre-built Azure Linux 3.0 tar on /dev/shm (tmpfs, supports device nodes).
#   Image includes 7 device nodes (/dev/null, /dev/zero, etc.) pre-created in the tar.
#   /dev/shm is a 126GB tmpfs accessible from both build and compute nodes.
#   Bootstrap:localimage bypasses registry fetching entirely.
#   Layer has no device nodes - pre-created ones in tar satisfy Apptainer's needs.
# RUNTIME: Job script installs Python + CUDA on compute node.

Bootstrap: localimage
From: /dev/shm/azurelinux-with-dev.tar
